rops":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"收起详情"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["成本"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["不花钱。和家里人商量一次，定下一个数额就行。难在怎么开口，别让老人觉得你在防着他"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["收益"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["最高检 2022 年发布养老诈骗典型案例时说，这类犯罪先用小恩小惠、亲情关怀骗取信任，再用虚假宣传和高额回报承诺骗走大额财物。其中一案，卖假收藏品的公司派员工给老人打扫卫生、陪聊天，甚至认「干亲」。卖货时把东西装进黑袋子封好，叮嘱老人不许打开，为的是不让老人的家人发现。这家公司收了 192 万余元，老板以集资诈骗罪判 7 年 6 个月。北京市地方金融管理局 2023 年提醒老人，别信骗子说的「不要告诉任何人」。拿不定主意时，多找家人、子女和信得过的邻居朋友商量，投资前多征求家人意见。美国联邦贸易委员会统计，60 岁以上的人报告的被骗总额，从 2020 年约 6 亿美元涨到 2024 年约 24 亿美元。涨的主要是单笔损失超过 10 万美元的案子。事先约好「超过多少钱的支出要先和某个人说一声」，等于让家里人在掏钱前知道这件事，也把这个决定往后拖了拖"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原始出处"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["最高人民检察院 (2022). 最高检发布打击整治养老诈骗犯罪典型案例（许某燕集资诈骗案及答记者问）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202206/t20220617_560010.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202206/t20220617_560010.shtml"]},"；北京市地方金融监督管理局 (2023). 揭秘专骗老年人新套路 提高防骗意识 守护好「钱袋子」. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://jrj.beijing.gov.cn/jrxcjy/jraq/ffffjzxkt/202311/t20231127_3310210.html","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://jrj.beijing.gov.cn/jrxcjy/jraq/ffffjzxkt/202311/t20231127_3310210.html"]},"；Federal Trade Commission (2025). FTC Issues Annual Report to Congress on Agency's Actions to Protect Older Adults（Protecting Older Consumers, 2024-2025）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2025/12/ftc-issues-annual-report-congress-agencys-actions-protect-older-adults","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.ftc.gov/news-events/news/press-releases/2025/12/ftc-issues-annual-report-congress-agencys-actions-protect-older-adults"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.spp.gov.cn/xwfbh/wsfbt/202206/t20220617_560010.shtml","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["打开来源链接"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["原书备注"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["没有研究比过定了这条规矩的家庭少被骗多少。给 B 是因为骗局的套路和「多和家人商量」出自检察机关和金融监管部门，性质和第 6 条（以房养老）一样。人一激动就更容易被说动，见第 4 条（我要回去和家里人商量）。防骗通则见第 8 节和第 13 节。别把这件事讲成「怕你被骗」。讲成「家里的钱统一记账」，老人更容易接受。也别把老人的所有钱都交给子女保管，那会引出另一类纠纷"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["我的备注"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["写下对自己有用的提醒…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/tip/17-02"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-left","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 19-7-7 7-7"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M19 12H5"},"children":[]}]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["上一条"]},"把遗嘱立了，记住后立的推翻先立的，公证遗嘱不再优先"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link next","href":"/tip/17-04"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"small","props":{},"children":["下一条"]},"给老人备好一句随时能说出口的推辞：「我要回去和家里人商量」"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"section","props":{"className":"life-tip-related"},"children":[{"tag":"h2","props":{},"children":["本主题的其他建议"]},{"tag":"ul","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/17-01"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["趁老人清醒，书面指定将来的监护人"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["趁老人头脑还清楚，花几百元去公证处办一份书面文件，写明将来谁当他的监护人。没有这份文件，等老人不能自己做决定了，谁替他签字、谁替他管钱，要…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/17-05"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["凡是让老人先交钱的「投资养老」都别碰：办卡、买床位、买养老公寓、旅居养老、买老年产品是同一套非法集资"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["让老人先交钱、又许诺回报的养老名目，都是同一套骗局：办卡、买床位、买养老公寓、旅居养老、开会卖老年产品。按规定，这种钱亏了只能自己认。有人…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/17-06"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["除了保险公司的住房反向抵押养老保险，其他「以房养老」都别碰，绝不抵押房子去买理财"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["正规的以房养老只有一种，就是保险公司的住房反向抵押养老保险，还在试点。上门推销的那种和它毫无关系，是骗老人抵押房子，再拿借来的钱买它推荐的…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/17-07"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家里老人长期卧床或重度失能，去参保地医保部门申请长期护理保险；它不是只发给老人"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["长期护理保险帮你出请人照护的钱。家里有人重度失能、持续半年以上，就去参保地医保部门申请。护理费不用先自己垫，职工参保的报七成左右，城乡居民…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/17-08"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["家里有人长期卧床，把压疮当头号敌人：上电动气垫床、定时翻身、每天看一遍骨头突出的地方"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["髋部骨折开刀前就有压疮的老人，30 天内去世的可能性高约两成。换电动气垫床，新长压疮的少约六成。按时翻身真正做到位，少约七成。别让人长时间…"]}]}]},{"tag":"li","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/tip/17-09"},"children":[{"tag":"strong","props":{},"children":["老人的白内障已经影响看路，就去眼科评估做手术；两只眼都有的，第二只别拖太久"]},{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["70 岁以上的女性尽快做第一只眼的白内障手术，一年里跌倒的次数少约三成四，骨折的人也少了。但摔过跤的人数没有少。第二只眼做不做，跌倒上没看…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-text-link","href":"/book/17"},"children":["阅读整个主题：家里有老人"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"15","height":"15","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M5 12h14"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"},"children":[]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"tag":"aside","props":{"className":"life-ad-space life-ad-space-sponsored","data-ad-placement":"ad_footer","data-ad-group":"reading","data-ad-creative":"read_product","data-ad-ready":"false","aria-l